   "cooked": "<h1>\n<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#tec-rewards-distribution-round-32-090523-to-020623-1\" name=\"tec-rewards-distribution-round-32-090523-to-020623-1\"></a>TEC Rewards Distribution - round-32  - 09/05/23 to 02/06/23</h1>\n<p>This period covers praise given between <strong>09 May 2023 and 02 June 2023</strong>. We allocated <strong>253.5121612</strong> TEC tokens for rewards, tokens for rewards, using our new distribution system which boosts non-paid contributors. Some praise accounts still haven’t been activated so the total amount below will be less than what we set aside to distribute.</p>\n<p>Out of the total rewards:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>90% of the tokens were given as praise rewards <img alt=\":pray:\" class=\"emoji\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/pray.png?v=12\" title=\":pray:\" width=\"20\"/>\n</li>\n<li>7% distributed among quantifiers <img alt=\":balance_scale:\" class=\"emoji\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/balance_scale.png?v=12\" title=\":balance_scale:\" width=\"20\"/>\n</li>\n<li>3% assigned to the reward board <img alt=\":memo:\" class=\"emoji\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/memo.png?v=12\" title=\":memo:\" width=\"20\"/>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This data has been reviewed by the Quantifiers and the Reward Board, and has been submitted for distribution to the <a href=\"https://xdai.aragon.blossom.software/#/rewardboardtec/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Reward Board DAO</a></p>\n<p>You can check out the <a>full period analysis here</a>. <img alt=\":bar_chart:\" class=\"emoji\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/bar_chart.png?v=12\" title=\":bar_chart:\" width=\"20\"/></p>\n<p>This post will be open to the community for review for 48 hours then submitted to the Reward Board for final execution. <img alt=\":heavy_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/heavy_check_mark.png?v=12\" title=\":heavy_check_mark:\" width=\"20\"/></p>\n<p>The Rewards Distribution for this round is as follows:</p>\n<div class=\"md-table\">\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Username</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:right\">Rewards in TEC</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">Isaac (enti)<span class=\"hashtag\">#1546</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">18.24432354</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">tamarandom</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">24.01513935</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">m-r-g-t#8344</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">12.8309635</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">gideonro#0</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">15.78835691</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">natesuits#4789</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">7.10476061</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">bear100#9085</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">5.262785637</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">Marathonmind#3078</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">4.78036362</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">akrtws#4246</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">8.508170113</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">curiousrabbit.eth#0790</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">7.631039173</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">liviade#1387</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">7.10476061</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">Griff (<img alt=\":purple_heart:\" class=\"emoji\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/purple_heart.png?v=12\" title=\":purple_heart:\" width=\"20\"/>,<img alt=\":purple_heart:\" class=\"emoji\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/purple_heart.png?v=12\" title=\":purple_heart:\" width=\"20\"/>)<span class=\"hashtag